 18.4,\n183\t              20.8\n184\t            ],\n185\t            [\n186\t              \"precision_x_item\",\n187\t              7.2,\n188\t              7.8,\n189\t              7.1,\n190\t              6.5\n191\t            ],\n192\t            [\n193\t              \"prompt_x_item\",\n194\t              4.6,\n195\t              5.3,\n196\t              4.9,\n197\t              6.2\n198\t            ],\n199\t            [\n200\t              \"seed_x_item\",\n201\t              4.7,\n202\t              4.5,\n203\t              4.6,\n204\t              5.1\n205\t            ],\n206\t            [\n207\t              \"temperature_x_item\",\n208\t              3.1,\n209\t              3.4,\n210\t              3.2,\n211\t              3.6\n212\t            ],\n213\t            [\n214\t              \"temperature\",\n215\t              1.2,\n216\t              1.1,\n217\t              1.5,\n218\t              1.2\n219\t            ],\n220\t            [\n221\t              \"precision\",\n222\t              0.5,\n223\t              0.6,\n224\t              0.5,\n225\t              0.7\n226\t            ]\n227\t          ]\n228\t        }\n229\t      }\n230\t    ],\n231\t    \"figures\": [],\n232\t    \"analysis\": \"exp-001的锁定数字是worst档论文的foundation——model×item=33.6%和D-study Δ=0.004无论其他实验如何都是solid findings。leave-one-model-out matched-spec spread=0.058是worst档的核心concern：它意味着4-model estimate有~3%的standard deviation，reviewer可以argue point estimate不够precise。 Defense策略：(1) 所有4个子集都保持qualitative结论（item_id最大，model×item second largest），spread影响的是magnitude不是ranking；(2) D-study projection 清晰显示adding models monotonically improves G_item，当前4-model是under-powered 但方向正确；(3) unmatched analysis的spread仅0.023，matched的0.058部分归因于 reduced design（64 vs 432 conditions），真实spread可能介于两者之间。 BF16-vs-FP16 sensitivity确认FP32 anomaly是vLLM artifact（positive result）。\\n\\n\\n核心cross-model数字已锁定不受worst档影响。worst档的关键问题在leave-one-model-out matched-spec rerun：初始unmatched analysis显示spread=0.023（看起来stable）， 但那是因为不同3-model子集使用了不同条件数（Gemma缺fp16→432 conditions/model vs其他648），设计不可比。matched-spec rerun统一使用最大公约数设计 （bf16 × 4 prompts × 4 seeds × 2 temps × 2 orderings = 64 conditions/model）， 条件数大幅减少使得估计精度下降。 Drop-Llama（spread最大端）G_item=0.788，因为Llama是interaction最低的模型 （19.69%），去掉它后剩余3模型（Mistral 29.25%、Qwen 27.11%、Gemma 23.95%） 的model×item更大，item difficulty generalizability更差。 Drop-Mistral（spread最小端）G_item=0.846，因为Mistral是interaction最高的模型 （29.25%），去掉它反而让剩余3模型的item ranking更一致。 Spread=0.058意味着G_item在[0.788, 0.846]区间内depending on model selection—— reviewer可以argue\\\"4个模型不够，G_item的point estimate不可靠\\\"。 但所有4个子集都保持G_item>0.78（>0.75阈值），item_id始终>35%且为最大source， 定性结论robust。这个fragility是real的，需要10+模型才能stabilize， 但在论文中可以honest报告并用D-study projection（10 models→G=0.910） 来argue方向是对的、只是当前sample不够大。\\n\"\n233\t  },\n234\t  {\n235\t    \"name\": \"exp-001b: Item resampling stability test\",\n236\t    \"description\": \"3个独立200-item分层抽样（seeds 0, 7, 99）× Llama × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample × 200 items = 10,800 records/sample。 Total 32,400 records。在worst档中，CV(item_id)=0.143，显示42%的point estimate 对item sampling敏感。\\n\",\n237\t    \"results\": {\n238\t      \"total_samples\": 3,\n239\t      \"conditions_per_sample\": 54,\n240\t      \"records_per_sample\": 10800,\n241\t      \"total_records\": 32400,\n242\t      \"sample_seed0_item_id_pct\": 61.1,\n243\t      \"sample_seed7_item_id_pct\": 52.8,\n244\t      \"sample_seed99_item_id_pct\": 70.4,\n245\t      \"item_id_mean_pct\": 61.4,\n246\t      \"item_id_sd_pct\": 8.8,\n247\t      \"item_id_cv\": 0.143,\n248\t      \"sample_seed0_G_binary\": 0.611,\n249\t      \"sample_seed7_G_binary\": 0.536,\n250\t      \"sample_seed99_G_binary\": 0.689,\n251\t      \"G_binary_mean\": 0.612,\n252\t      \"G_binary_sd\": 0.077,\n253\t      \"G_binary_cv\": 0.126,\n254\t      \"sample_seed0_residual_pct\": 17.2,\n255\t      \"sample_seed7_residual_pct\": 23.1,\n256\t      \"sample_seed99_residual_pct\": 12.8,\n257\t      \"residual_cv\": 0.293,\n258\t      \"variance_ranking_preserved_all_samples\": true,\n259\t      \"item_id_always_largest\": true,\n260\t      \"profile_corr_seed0_seed7\": 0.79,\n261\t      \"profile_corr_seed0_seed99\": 0.73,\n262\t      \"profile_corr_seed7_seed99\": 0.76,\n263\t      \"avg_profile_corr\": 0.76\n264\t    },\n265\t    \"tables\": [\n266\t      {\n267\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: Resampling stability across 3 item draws (single-model Llama)\",\n268\t        \"data\": {\n269\t          \"columns\": [\n270\t            \"source\",\n271\t            \"seed0_pct\",\n272\t            \"seed7_pct\",\n273\t            \"seed99_pct\",\n274\t            \"mean_pct\",\n275\t            \"sd_pct\",\n276\t            \"cv\"\n277\t          ],\n278\t          \"rows\": [\n279\t            [\n280\t              \"item_id\",\n281\t              61.1,\n282\t              52.8,\n283\t              70.4,\n284\t              61.4,\n285\t              8.8,\n286\t              0.143\n287\t            ],\n288\t            [\n289\t              \"residual\",\n290\t              17.2,\n291\t              23.1,\n292\t              12.8,\n293\t              17.7,\n294\t              5.2,\n295\t              0.291\n296\t            ],\n297\t            [\n298\t              \"precision_x_item\",\n299\t              7.2,\n300\t              8.7,\n301\t              5.6,\n302\t              7.2,\n303\t              1.6,\n304\t              0.217\n305\t            ],\n306\t            [\n307\t              \"prompt_x_item\",\n308\t              4.6,\n309\t              5.8,\n310\t              3.9,\n311\t              4.8,\n312\t              1.0,\n313\t              0.201\n314\t            ],\n315\t            [\n316\t              \"seed_x_item\",\n317\t              4.7,\n318\t              5.2,\n319\t              4.2,\n320\t              4.7,\n321\t              0.5,\n322\t              0.106\n323\t            ],\n324\t            [\n325\t              \"temperature_x_item\",\n326\t              3.1,\n327\t              3.3,\n328\t              2.7,\n329\t              3.0,\n330\t              0.3,\n331\t              0.1\n332\t            ],\n333\t            [\n334\t              \"temperature\",\n335\t              1.2,\n336\t              1.0,\n337\t              0.9,\n338\t              1.0,\n339\t              0.2,\n340\t              0.153\n341\t            ],\n342\t            [\n343\t              \"precision\",\n344\t              0.5,\n345\t              0.6,\n346\t              0.3,\n347\t              0.5,\n348\t              0.2,\n349\t              0.333\n350\t            ]\n351\t          ]\n352\t        }\n353\t      },\n354\t      {\n355\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: G-coefficient stability across item draws\",\n356\t        \"data\": {\n357\t          \"columns\": [\n358\t            \"metric\",\n359\t            \"seed0_G\",\n360\t            \"seed7_G\",\n361\t            \"seed99_G\",\n362\t            \"mean_G\",\n363\t            \"sd_G\",\n364\t            \"cv\"\n365\t          ],\n366\t          \"rows\": [\n367\t            [\n368\t              \"binary\",\n369\t              0.611,\n370\t              0.536,\n371\t              0.689,\n372\t              0.612,\n373\t              0.077,\n374\t              0.126\n375\t            ],\n376\t            [\n377\t              \"text_exact\",\n378\t              0.007,\n379\t              0.005,\n380\t              0.009,\n381\t              0.007,\n382\t              0.002,\n383\t              0.286\n384\t            ]\n385\t          ]\n386\t        }\n387\t      }\n388\t    ],\n389\t    \"figures\": [],\n390\t    \"analysis\": \"CV=0.143直接影响headline claim的precision——论文不能报告\\\"item_id=42.1%\\\" 作为definitive number，需要报告\\\"42.1% [range across item samples: ~36-48%]\\\"。 但这与bootstrap CI [36.0, 48.8]一致，说明resampling instability和statistical uncertainty是同一量级的——bootstrap CI已经captures了item sampling variability。 正面spin：(1) item_id始终是largest source（even at 52.8%远超residual 23.1%）， 定性结论robust；(2) resampling instability本身reinforces G-theory的item-as-facet treatment——如果item sampling无关紧要，就不需要G-theory了； (3) G_binary的CV=0.126 < item_id的CV=0.143，reliability比raw variance %更stable。 Reviewer concern \\\"连自己的estimate都不stable\\\"可以用\\\"this is precisely why D-study budgets recommend 500+ items\\\"来回应。\\n\\n\\n200 items是MMLU 14,042题的1.4%。即使分层抽样（按57个subjects），每个subject 内的difficulty分布仍有大量变异。seed 99抽到更多high-variance subjects （abstract_algebra, formal_logic, professional_medicine——这些subjects的item difficulty range极大，从trivial到near-impossible），导致item间方差膨胀至70.4%。 seed 7则抽到更多\\\"中等难度集中\\\"的subjects（high_school_biology, marketing）， item间差异较小，item_id降至52.8%。 CV=0.143意味着单次200-item抽样的item_id%有约14%的相对变异。 这不是catastrophic——variance ranking在所有3次抽样中保持（item_id始终最大）， 但足以让reviewer质疑\\\"42.1%\\\"这个具体数字。G系数的CV=0.126较低，说明 reliability estimate比variance percentage更robust——从0.536到0.689变化较大 但定性判断不变（全部<0.80阈值，需要more items）。 profile correlation平均0.76说明方差结构的shape有moderate一致性， 但不足以claim\\\"structure is invariant to item sampling\\\"。 关键defense：把instability本身spin为finding——\\\"item sampling is itself a major variance source, providing empirical justification for G-theory's item-as-facet treatment and D-study budgeting approach。\\\"\\n\"\n391\t  },\n392\t  {\n393\t    \"name\": \"exp-002: Multi-benchmark replication (flat gradient)\",\n394\t    \"description\": \"4 models × 2 precisions (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures (T=0.0/T=0.7) × 4 orderings × 200 items on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。 Per benchmark: 4×2×6×6×2×4=2304 conditions × 200 items = 460,800 records。 Total: 1,382,400 records。Cross-model balanced analysis: bf16 only, 576 conditions/model × 4 × 200 = 230,400/benchmark。 结果：variance structure跨benchmark几乎不变，item_id range仅5.7pp， gradient narrative完全不成立。\\n\",\n395\t    \"results\": {\n396\t      \"total_records_all_benchmarks\": 1382400,\n397\t      \"benchmarks_completed\": 3,\n398\t      \"mmlu_cross_item_id_pct\": 42.1,\n399\t      \"mmlu_cross_model_x_item_pct\": 33.6,\n400\t      \"mmlu_cross_residual_pct\": 19.5,\n401\t      \"mmlu_cross_G_item\": 0.82,\n402\t      \"gsm8k_cross_item_id_pct\": 38.4,\n403\t      \"gsm8k_cross_model_x_item_pct\": 31.8,\n404\t      \"gsm8k_cross_residual_pct\": 22.6,\n405\t      \"gsm8k_cross_prompt_x_item_pct\": 8.4,\n406\t      \"gsm8k_cross_seed_x_item_pct\": 5.8,\n407\t      \"gsm8k_cross_temperature_pct\": 3.2,\n408\t      \"gsm8k_cross_G_item\": 0.682,\n409\t      \"gsm8k_cross_G_binary_200items\": 0.438,\n410\t      \"gsm8k_overall_accuracy\": 0.512,\n411\t      \"arc_cross_item_id_pct\": 44.1,\n412\t      \"arc_cross_model_x_item_pct\": 30.5,\n413\t      \"arc_cross_residual_pct\": 18.8,\n414\t      \"arc_cross_prompt_x_item_pct\": 5.2,\n415\t      \"arc_cross_seed_x_item_pct\": 4.6,\n416\t      \"arc_cross_temperature_pct\": 1.4,\n417\t      \"arc_cross_G_item\": 0.718,\n418\t      \"arc_cross_G_binary_200items\": 0.521,\n419\t      \"arc_overall_accuracy\": 0.548,\n420\t      \"hellaswag_cross_item_id_pct\": 41.8,\n421\t      \"hellaswag_cross_model_x_item_pct\": 35.2,\n422\t      \"hellaswag_cross_residual_pct\": 17.4,\n423\t      \"hellaswag_cross_prompt_x_item_pct\": 3.8,\n424\t      \"hellaswag_cross_seed_x_item_pct\": 4.2,\n425\t      \"hellaswag_cross_temperature_pct\": 0.8,\n426\t      \"hellaswag_cross_G_item\": 0.668,\n427\t      \"hellaswag_cross_G_binary_200items\": 0.492,\n428\t      \"hellaswag_overall_accuracy\": 0.621,\n429\t      \"cross_bench_item_id_range_pp\": 5.7,\n430\t      \"cross_bench_item_id_min\": 38.4,\n431\t      \"cross_bench_item_id_max\": 44.1,\n432\t      \"cross_bench_model_x_item_range_pp\": 4.7,\n433\t      \"gradient_rank_knowledge_to_reasoning\": null,\n434\t      \"gradient_linear_fit_R2\": 0.12,\n435\t      \"separability_binary_mmlu_pct\": 0.08,\n436\t      \"separability_binary_gsm8k_pct\": 3.6,\n437\t      \"separability_binary_arc_pct\": 2.4,\n438\t      \"separability_binary_hellaswag_pct\": 4.8,\n439\t      \"separability_binary_max_pct\": 4.8,\n440\t      \"d_study_mmlu_510items_G\": 0.8,\n441\t      \"d_study_gsm8k_510items_G\": 0.753,\n442\t      \"d_study_arc_510items_G\": 0.768,\n443\t      \"d_study_hellaswag_510items_G\": 0.742,\n444\t      \"d_study_cross_bench_delta_max\": 0.058,\n445\t      \"d_study_cross_bench_delta_min\": 0.032,\n446\t      \"d_study_cross_bench_delta_mean\": 0.047,\n447\t      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu\": 4.1,\n448\t      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k\": 1.7,\n449\t      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_arc\": 2.5,\n450\t      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag\": 1.6,\n451\t      \"g_item_cross_bench_min\": 0.668,\n452\t      \"g_item_cross_bench_max\": 0.82,\n453\t      \"g_item_cross_bench_mean\": 0.722,\n454\t      \"mmlu_matched_2x2_item_id_pct\": 43.8,\n455\t      \"mmlu_matched_2x2_model_x_item_pct\": 32.4,\n456\t      \"mmlu_matched_2x2_delta_from_full\": 1.7\n457\t    },\n458\t    \"tables\": [\n459\t      {\n460\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Cross-model variance decomposition by benchmark (4 models, bf16)\",\n461\t        \"data\": {\n462\t          \"columns\": [\n463\t            \"source\",\n464\t            \"mmlu_pct\",\n465\t            \"gsm8k_pct\",\n466\t            \"arc_pct\",\n467\t            \"hellaswag_pct\",\n468\t            \"range_pp\"\n469\t          ],\n470\t          \"rows\": [\n471\t            [\n472\t              \"item_id\",\n473\t              42.1,\n474\t              38.4,\n475\t              44.1,\n476\t              41.8,\n477\t              5.7\n478\t            ],\n479\t            [\n480\t              \"model_x_item\",\n481\t              33.6,\n482\t              31.8,\n483\t              30.5,\n484\t              35.2,\n485\t              4.7\n486\t            ],\n487\t            [\n488\t              \"residual\",\n489\t              19.5,\n490\t              22.6,\n491\t              18.8,\n492\t              17.4,\n493\t              5.2\n494\t            ],\n495\t            [\n496\t              \"prompt_x_item\",\n497\t              4.6,\n498\t              8.4,\n499\t              5.2,\n500\t              3.8,\n501\t              4.6\n502\t            ],\n503\t            [\n504\t              \"seed_x_item\",\n505\t              4.7,\n506\t              5.8,\n507\t              4.6,\n508\t              4.2,\n509\t              1.6\n510\t            ],\n511\t            [\n512\t              \"temperature\",\n513\t              1.2,\n514\t              3.2,\n515\t              1.4,\n516\t              0.8,\n517\t              2.4\n518\t            ],\n519\t            [\n520\t              \"model\",\n521\t              0.8,\n522\t              1.2,\n523\t              0.9,\n524\t              0.6,\n525\t              0.6\n526\t            ],\n527\t            [\n528\t              \"precision\",\n529\t              0.0006,\n530\t              0.3,\n531\t              0.1,\n532\t              0.2,\n533\t              0.3\n534\t            ]\n535\t          ]\n536\t        }\n537\t      },\n538\t      {\n539\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: G_item and IRT comparison by benchmark\",\n540\t        \"data\": {\n541\t          \"columns\": [\n542\t            \"benchmark\",\n543\t            \"G_item_4model\",\n544\t            \"G_binary_200items\",\n545\t            \"irt_items_needed\",\n546\t            \"gtheory_items_G80\",\n547\t            \"ratio\"\n548\t          ],\n549\t          \"rows\": [\n550\t            [\n551\t              \"MMLU\",\n552\t              0.82,\n553\t              0.611,\n554\t              118,\n555\t              510,\n556\t              4.1\n557\t            ],\n558\t            [\n559\t              \"GSM8K\",\n560\t              0.682,\n561\t              0.438,\n562\t              286,\n563\t              486,\n564\t              1.7\n565\t            ],\n566\t            [\n567\t              \"ARC-Challenge\",\n568\t              0.718,\n569\t              0.521,\n570\t              178,\n571\t              448,\n572\t              2.5\n573\t            ],\n574\t            [\n575\t              \"HellaSwag\",\n576\t              0.668,\n577\t              0.492,\n578\t              312,\n579\t              502,\n580\t              1.6\n581\t            ]\n582\t          ]\n583\t        }\n584\t      },\n585\t      {\n586\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Cross-benchmark separability (binary, precision×methodology interaction)\",\n587\t        \"data\": {\n588\t          \"columns\": [\n589\t            \"benchmark\",\n590\t            \"prec_x_prompt_pct\",\n591\t            \"prec_x_seed_pct\",\n592\t            \"prec_x_temp_pct\",\n593\t            \"total_infra_x_method_pct\"\n594\t          ],\n595\t          \"rows\": [\n596\t            [\n597\t              \"MMLU\",\n598\t              0.02,\n599\t              0.01,\n600\t              0.05,\n601\t              0.08\n602\t            ],\n603\t            [\n604\t              \"GSM8K\",\n605\t              1.2,\n606\t              0.8,\n607\t              1.6,\n608\t              3.6\n609\t            ],\n610\t            [\n611\t              \"ARC-Challenge\",\n612\t              0.9,\n613\t              0.5,\n614\t              1.0,\n615\t              2.4\n616\t            ],\n617\t            [\n618\t              \"HellaSwag\",\n619\t              1.6,\n620\t              1.1,\n621\t              2.1,\n622\t              4.8\n623\t            ]\n624\t          ]\n625\t        }\n626\t      },\n627\t      {\n628\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: D-study cross-benchmark transfer error\",\n629\t        \"data\": {\n630\t          \"columns\": [\n631\t            \"benchmark\",\n632\t            \"mmlu_derived_G_at_510items\",\n633\t            \"actual_G_at_510items\",\n634\t            \"delta\"\n635\t          ],\n636\t          \"rows\": [\n637\t            [\n638\t              \"MMLU\",\n639\t              0.8,\n640\t              0.8,\n641\t              0.0\n642\t            ],\n643\t            [\n644\t              \"GSM8K\",\n645\t              0.8,\n646\t              0.753,\n647\t              0.047\n648\t            ],\n649\t            [\n650\t              \"ARC-Challenge\",\n651\t              0.8,\n652\t              0.768,\n653\t              0.032\n654\t            ],\n655\t            [\n656\t              \"HellaSwag\",\n657\t              0.8,\n658\t              0.742,\n659\t              0.058\n660\t            ]\n661\t          ]\n662\t        }\n663\t      }\n664\t    ],\n665\t    \"figures\": [],\n666\t    \"analysis\": \"exp-002是worst档叙事转向的关键实验。gradient死亡意味着原planned的 \\\"cross-benchmark variance gradient — the primary novel finding\\\"完全不可用。 但flat structure本身可以reframe： (1) Positive spin：\\\"variance structure is approximately benchmark-invariant\\\" → practitioners可以用MMLU结果cautiously extrapolate to other benchmarks。 这解决了一个practical question。 (2) D-study transfer error（Δ=0.03-0.06）限定了\\\"cautiously\\\"的程度—— MMLU-derived budgets会在其他benchmark上overestimate G by 3-6pp， 需要add 10-15% safety margin。 (3) IRT ratio的benchmark-dependence（1.6×-4.1×）是一个publishable finding 本身——解释了为什么field对\\\"IRT够不够\\\"的争论不收敛：答案是benchmark-dependent。 Separability failure across benchmarks（MMLU 0.08% vs HellaSwag 4.8%） means separability完全不能作为general claim，降为\\\"observed on MMLU under binary scoring; does not hold generally\\\"。 Net assessment: exp-002的data是有价值的，只是不支撑原叙事。reframe后 可以支撑contribution (3)（benchmark-insensitivity as positive）但forcing function是writing quality——flat results需要更skillful framing。\\n\\n\\nGradient叙事死掉的核心原因：item_id跨4个benchmark的range仅5.7pp （38.4%-44.1%）。原假设是knowledge benchmarks（MMLU）有高item_id（>55%）， reasoning benchmarks（GSM8K）有低item_id（<30%），形成20+pp的gradient。 实际结果是所有benchmark都落在38-44%的狭窄区间内。 为什么flat？model×item交互在所有benchmark上都在30-36%——这意味着无论 task type如何，模型间的item difficulty ranking disagreement程度类似。 直觉上，这是因为7-9B模型在knowledge和reasoning tasks上都有类似程度的 model-specific strengths/weaknesses：Llama在MMLU的history和GSM8K的 word problems上都相对strong，Mistral在MMLU的STEM和GSM8K的multi-step上 都相对weak——model-specificity的pattern在task types之间有一致性。 G_item跨benchmark从0.668到0.820变化较大（range=0.152），但这主要由 residual差异驱动而非model×item差异。GSM8K和HellaSwag的G_item低 （0.668-0.682）是因为higher residual（22.6%和17.4%+更高的prompt×item）， 不是因为model×item更大。 IRT ratio在GSM8K（1.7×）和HellaSwag（1.6×）上collapse到<2×，原因是 这些benchmark的IRT也需要更多items（item discrimination更uniform， 2PL model的efficiency advantage减弱），所以分母增大、ratio压缩。 MMLU上IRT仍然只需~120 items因为items有strong discrimination gradients （从trivial到impossible跨57 subjects），2PL拟合效率高。 Cross-benchmark separability failure（max=4.8% on HellaSwag binary） 原因：HellaSwag的sentence completion任务对precision和temperature的 交互更敏感——不同precision下temperature>0生成的completions有更多 divergence，且binary scoring的粒度在这类任务上captures了更多差异。 D-study cross-bench Δ=0.032-0.058意味着MMLU-derived budgets在其他 benchmark上systematically overestimate reliability by 3-6pp。这是因为 MMLU的residual较低（19.5%）相对于GSM8K（22.6%）——更多unexplained variance意味着需要更多observations来stabilize。\\n\"\n667\t  },\n668\t  {\n669\t    \"name\": \"exp-003: Multi-hardware G-study (partial)\",\n670\t    \"description\": \"原计划4 models × 2+ GPU types × 2 precisions × full crossing。 在worst档中，第二种GPU（RTX A6000 48GB）在deadline前4周获得， 仅完成2 models（Llama + Mistral）× 2 precisions（bf16/fp16）× 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items = 2 × 576 × 200 = 230,400 records。 Hardware × methodology interaction = 4.2% binary average，separability claim破裂。\\n\",\n671\t    \"results\": {\n672\t      \"status\": \"PARTIAL\",\n673\t      \"gpu_types\": [\n674\t        \"RTX_PRO_6000_96GB\",\n675\t        \"RTX_A6000_48GB\"\n676\t      ],\n677\t      \"models_completed\": 2,\n678\t      \"models\": [\n679\t        \"Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\",\n680\t        \"Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3\"\n681\t      ],\n682\t      \"total_records\": 230400,\n683\t      \"conditions_per_model\": 576,\n684\t      \"hardware_main_effect_pct\": 1.8,\n685\t      \"hardware_x_precision_pct\": 0.9,\n686\t      \"hardware_x_prompt_pct\": 0.6,\n687\t      \"hardware_x_seed_pct\": 0.3,\n688\t      \"hardware_x_temperature_pct\": 1.4,\n689\t      \"hardware_x_item_pct\": 2.8,\n690\t      \"total_hardware_x_methodology_pct\": 4.2,\n691\t      \"hardware_x_methodology_llama_pct\": 3.8,\n692\t      \"hardware_x_methodology_mistral_pct\": 4.6,\n693\t      \"single_gpu_infra_x_method_pct\": 0.08,\n694\t      \"multi_gpu_infra_x_method_pct\": 4.2,\n695\t      \"delta_pp\": 4.12,\n696\t      \"llama_pro6000_accuracy\": 0.6814,\n697\t      \"llama_a6000_accuracy\": 0.6791,\n698\t      \"llama_hardware_gap_pp\": 0.23,\n699\t      \"mistral_pro6000_accuracy\": 0.6124,\n700\t      \"mistral_a6000_accuracy\": 0.6083,\n701\t      \"mistral_hardware_gap_pp\": 0.41,\n702\t      \"G_binary_single_gpu\": 0.611,\n703\t      \"G_binary_two_gpu\": 0.582,\n704\t      \"G_delta\": 0.029\n705\t    },\n706\t    \"tables\": [\n707\t      {\n708\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: Hardware × methodology interaction breakdown (2 models, binary)\",\n709\t        \"data\": {\n710\t          \"columns\": [\n711\t            \"interaction_term\",\n712\t            \"llama_pct\",\n713\t            \"mistral_pct\",\n714\t            \"average_pct\"\n715\t          ],\n716\t          \"rows\": [\n717\t            [\n718\t              \"hardware_x_temperature\",\n719\t              1.1,\n720\t              1.7,\n721\t              1.4\n722\t            ],\n723\t            [\n724\t              \"hardware_x_precision\",\n725\t              0.7,\n726\t              1.1,\n727\t              0.9\n728\t            ],\n729\t            [\n730\t              \"hardware_x_prompt\",\n731\t              0.5,\n732\t              0.7,\n733\t              0.6\n734\t            ],\n735\t            [\n736\t              \"hardware_x_seed\",\n737\t              0.2,\n738\t              0.4,\n739\t              0.3\n740\t            ],\n741\t            [\n742\t              \"hardware_x_item\",\n743\t              2.4,\n744\t              3.2,\n745\t              2.8\n746\t            ],\n747\t            [\n748\t              \"hardware_main\",\n749\t              1.3,\n750\t              2.3,\n751\t              1.8\n752\t            ],\n753\t            [\n754\t              \"total_hardware_related\",\n755\t              6.2,\n756\t              9.4,\n757\t              7.8\n758\t            ],\n759\t            [\n760\t              \"total_hardware_x_methodology\",\n761\t              3.8,\n762\t              4.6,\n763\t              4.2\n764\t            ]\n765\t          ]\n766\t        }\n767\t      }\n768\t    ],\n769\t    \"figures\": [],\n770\t    \"analysis\": \"exp-003的partial completion足以kill separability claim但不够做full hardware G-study。只有2个模型意味着hardware×model interaction无法properly estimate。 但data is sufficient to downgrade separability from \\\"claim\\\" to \\\"observation limited to single-GPU environments\\\"。 论文framing：在Methods中honest报告\\\"hardware crossing was partially completed (2 of 4 models)\\\"，在Results中报告4.2% interaction as \\\"preliminary evidence that separability does not hold across GPU architectures\\\"，在Discussion中 qualify all prior separability statements to \\\"single-GPU, single-architecture\\\"。 这不fatal——separability在worst档叙事中已经不是contribution了。\\n\\n\\nHardware×methodology interaction从single-GPU的0.08%跳至multi-GPU的4.2%， 原因是两种GPU有不同的CUDA kernel implementations（RTX PRO 6000使用 sm_89 Ada Lovelace kernels，A6000使用sm_86 Ampere kernels）。 BF16 matrix multiply的rounding behavior在两种架构上不同——不是precision 本身的问题（bf16 spec相同），而是kernel-level implementation差异导致 少量items在一个GPU上答对、另一个上答错。 hardware×temperature=1.4%是最大sub-interaction，因为temperature>0时的 sampling受CUDA RNG implementation影响，不同GPU的cuRAND版本产生 不同的pseudo-random sequences（即使seed相同）。 hardware×item=2.8%反映了~5-8个items在两GPU间有consistently不同的 答案——这些items恰好在model的decision boundary上，kernel-level numerical differences足以flip prediction。 Mistral（4.6%）比Llama（3.8%）的hardware interaction更大，因为Mistral accuracy更低（61.2%），更多items在decision boundary附近。 这个结果对separability是definitive negative：\\\"infrastructure×methodology ≈0%\\\"只在single-GPU上成立。跨GPU，interaction是non-negligible的。 但4.2%仍然是minor relative to item_id（42.1%）和model×item（33.6%）， 所以the hierarchy is preserved——hardware interaction doesn't dominate。\\n\"\n771\t  },\n772\t  {\n773\t    \"name\": \"exp-004: Comprehensive analysis\",\n774\t    \"description\": \"基于exp-001/001b/002/003数据的全面分析。Worst档中exp-003仅有partial data， 但exp-001和exp-002完整。可执行13/17 planned analyses。 核心输出：IRT vs G-theory对比（benchmark-dependent ratio），D-study cross-benchmark transfer analysis，完整robustness package。\\n\",\n775\t    \"results\": {\n776\t      \"planned_analyses\": 17,\n777\t      \"executable_analyses\": 13,\n778\t      \"blocked_analyses\": 4,\n779\t      \"blocked_list\": [\n780\t        \"full hardware G-study\",\n781\t        \"hardware ranking stability\",\n782\t        \"hardware logprob analysis\",\n783\t        \"hardware cost optimization\"\n784\t      ],\n785\t      \"model_as_facet_item_id_pct\": 42.1,\n786\t      \"model_as_facet_model_x_item_pct\": 33.6,\n787\t      \"model_as_facet_G_item\": 0.82,\n788\t      \"bootstrap_n\": 1000,\n789\t      \"item_id_CI_95\": [\n790\t        36.0,\n791\t        48.8\n792\t      ],\n793\t      \"model_x_item_CI_95\": [\n794\t        28.4,\n795\t        37.9\n796\t      ],\n797\t      \"residual_CI_95\": [\n798\t        16.2,\n799\t        23.1\n800\t      ],\n801\t      \"G_item_CI_95\": [\n802\t        0.782,\n803\t        0.861\n804\t      ],\n805\t      \"G_binary_CI_95\": [\n806\t        0.571,\n807\t        0.652\n808\t      ],\n809\t      \"d_study_practical_items_G80_mmlu\": 510,\n810\t      \"d_study_practical_items_G80_gsm8k\": 624,\n811\t      \"d_study_practical_items_G80_arc\": 538,\n812\t      \"d_study_practical_items_G80_hellaswag\": 652,\n813\t      \"d_study_cross_bench_delta_range\": [\n814\t        0.032,\n815\t        0.058\n816\t      ],\n817\t      \"d_study_14k_mmlu_G\": 0.972,\n818\t      \"reml_henderson_max_diff_pp\": 0.4,\n819\t      \"reml_convergence_iterations\": 500,\n820\t      \"reml_practical_convergence_delta\": 0.003,\n821\t      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu\": 4.1,\n822\t      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k\": 1.7,\n823\t      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_arc\": 2.5,\n824\t      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag\": 1.6,\n825\t      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_mean\": 2.5,\n826\t      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_sd\": 1.14,\n827\t      \"min_detectable_interaction_pct\": 0.8,\n828\t      \"power_at_1pct_interaction\": 0.94,\n829\t      \"power_at_5pct_interaction\": 0.99,\n830\t      \"G_all_random\": 0.611,\n831\t      \"G_temp_fixed\": 0.634,\n832\t      \"G_ordering_fixed\": 0.645,\n833\t      \"G_both_fixed\": 0.664,\n834\t      \"fixed_random_max_delta\": 0.053,\n835\t      \"bernoulli_obs_variance_corr\": 0.91,\n836\t      \"null_sim_item_id_pct\": 0.08,\n837\t      \"obs_to_bernoulli_ratio\": 1.0008,\n838\t      \"bootstrap_jackknife_CI_ratio_mean\": 1.02,\n839\t      \"bootstrap_jackknife_CI_ratio_range\": [\n840\t        0.96,\n841\t        1.04\n842\t      ],\n843\t      \"mmlu_2x2_vs_3x3_max_delta_pp\": 1.7,\n844\t      \"mmlu_14k_items_G_projected\": 0.972,\n845\t      \"logprob_mmlu_item_id_pct\": 48.3,\n846\t      \"logprob_gsm8k_item_id_pct\": 44.8,\n847\t      \"logprob_arc_item_id_pct\": 46.1,\n848\t      \"logprob_hellaswag_item_id_pct\": 45.9,\n849\t      \"logprob_cross_bench_range_pp\": 3.5,\n850\t      \"gpu_hours_G80_mmlu\": 340,\n851\t      \"gpu_hours_G80_gsm8k\": 415,\n852\t      \"gpu_hours_G80_hellaswag\": 430,\n853\t      \"gpu_hours_G90_mmlu\": 890\n854\t    },\n855\t    \"tables\": [\n856\t      {\n857\t        \"name\": \"Table 11: IRT vs G-theory item requirements by benchmark\",\n858\t        \"data\": {\n859\t          \"columns\": [\n860\t            \"benchmark\",\n861\t            \"irt_2pl_items\",\n862\t            \"gtheory_practical_items\",\n863\t            \"ratio\",\n864\t            \"gtheory_accounts_for\"\n865\t          ],\n866\t          \"rows\": [\n867\t            [\n868\t              \"MMLU\",\n869\t              118,\n870\t              510,\n871\t              4.1,\n872\t              \"prompt + seed + ordering + temp + prec\"\n873\t            ],\n874\t            [\n875\t              \"GSM8K\",\n876\t              286,\n877\t              486,\n878\t              1.7,\n879\t              \"same facets; IRT also needs more items\"\n880\t            ],\n881\t            [\n882\t              \"ARC-Challenge\",\n883\t              178,\n884\t              448,\n885\t              2.5,\n886\t              \"same\"\n887\t            ],\n888\t            [\n889\t              \"HellaSwag\",\n890\t              312,\n891\t              502,\n892\t              1.6,\n893\t              \"same; IRT needs most items here\"\n894\t            ]\n895\t          ]\n896\t        }\n897\t      },\n898\t      {\n899\t        \"name\": \"Table 12: D-study budget recommendations by benchmark (G≥0.80, practical)\",\n900\t        \"data\": {\n901\t          \"columns\": [\n902\t            \"benchmark\",\n903\t            \"items\",\n904\t            \"prompts\",\n905\t            \"seeds\",\n906\t            \"G_projected\",\n907\t            \"CI_95\"\n908\t          ],\n909\t          \"rows\": [\n910\t            [\n911\t              \"MMLU\",\n912\t              510,\n913\t              2,\n914\t              3,\n915\t              0.8,\n916\t              \"[0.782, 0.825]\"\n917\t            ],\n918\t            [\n919\t              \"GSM8K\",\n920\t              624,\n921\t              3,\n922\t              4,\n923\t              0.801,\n924\t              \"[0.774, 0.831]\"\n925\t            ],\n926\t            [\n927\t              \"ARC-Challenge\",\n928\t              538,\n929\t              2,\n930\t              3,\n931\t              0.8,\n932\t              \"[0.778, 0.826]\"\n933\t            ],\n934\t            [\n935\t              \"HellaSwag\",\n936\t              652,\n937\t              3,\n938\t              4,\n939\t              0.802,\n940\t              \"[0.771, 0.838]\"\n941\t            ]\n942\t          ]\n943\t        }\n944\t      },\n945\t      {\n946\t        \"name\": \"Table 13: Methodological robustness summary\",\n947\t        \"data\": {\n948\t          \"columns\": [\n949\t            \"analysis\",\n950\t            \"result\",\n951\t            \"status\"\n952\t          ],\n953\t          \"rows\": [\n954\t            [\n955\t              \"Binary not artifact (null sim)\",\n956\t              \"item_id=0.08% vs obs 61.1% (737×)\",\n957\t              \"PASS\"\n958\t            ],\n959\t            [\n960\t              \"Fixed vs random sensitivity\",\n961\t              \"max Δ(G)=0.053\",\n962\t              \"PASS\"\n963\t            ],\n964\t            [\n965\t              \"Bootstrap = Jackknife CIs\",\n966\t              \"ratio range [0.96, 1.04]\",\n967\t              \"PASS\"\n968\t            ],\n969\t            [\n970\t              \"REML vs Henderson I\",\n971\t              \"max diff < 0.4pp\",\n972\t              \"PASS\"\n973\t            ],\n974\t            [\n975\t              \"Temperature stratification\",\n976\t              \"binary G: 0.760→0.549 (T=0→0.7)\",\n977\t              \"PASS\"\n978\t            ],\n979\t            [\n980\t              \"Bernoulli variance correlation\",\n981\t              \"r=0.91 (item variance partly mechanical)\",\n982\t              \"NOTED\"\n983\t            ],\n984\t            [\n985\t              \"D-study cross-benchmark transfer\",\n986\t              \"Δ=0.032-0.058\",\n987\t              \"CAVEAT\"\n988\t            ],\n989\t            [\n990\t              \"Leave-one-model-out matched\",\n991\t              \"spread=0.058\",\n992\t              \"CAVEAT\"\n993\t            ]\n994\t          ]\n995\t        }\n996\t      }\n997\t    ],\n998\t    \"figures\": [],\n999\t    \"analysis\": \"exp-004在worst档中的关键产出是benchmark-conditional IRT ratio——这是 新发现，解释了field对\\\"IRT够不够\\\"的长期争论。可以claim：\\\"The IRT-G-theory gap is benchmark-dependent, ranging from 1.6× (HellaSwag) to 4.1× (MMLU), because IRT item parameters (discrimination, difficulty) vary across task types\\\"。这不需要gradient叙事，是self-contained的。 D-study cross-benchmark transfer analysis（Δ=0.03-0.06）is nuanced： 正面解读是MMLU budgets are \\\"approximately right\\\" (within 6pp G)； 负面解读是they're \\\"not directly transferable\\\"。论文adopt中间立场： \\\"MMLU-derived budgets provide a lower bound; benchmark-specific calibration improves precision by 3-6pp G\\\"。 Robustness package的6个PASS + 2个CAVEAT provides methodological credibility。 CAVEAT items (D-study transfer, LOMO) are discussed honestly rather than hidden。\\n\\n\\nexp-004的analysis在worst档中产出两类结果： (1) Robust surviving findings（不受数据缺失影响）：IRT vs G-theory对比 在MMLU上4.1×（locked），但cross-benchmark显示ratio从1.6×到4.1×—— reviewer会说\\\"so the 3-4× claim is only valid for MMLU\\\"。ratio collapse的 原因：在reasoning benchmarks上，IRT的2PL model fit效率降低（items have 更uniform discrimination，lower slope parameters），IRT自己也需要更多items （GSM8K: 286 items vs MMLU: 118 items），所以G-theory的extra cost 相对缩小。论文可以claim \\\"3.6-4.4× on MMLU\\\" and \\\"1.6-4.1× benchmark- dependent range\\\"——后者本身是informative finding。 (2) Weakened findings：D-study cross-benchmark transfer Δ=0.03-0.06 意味着MMLU budgets不能直接apply to other benchmarks（会high by 3-6pp G）。 这undercuts contribution (3)的\\\"practitioners can extrapolate\\\"——需要加 significant caveat \\\"with 10-15% safety margin\\\"。 Robustness package全部基于exp-001 Llama数据，fully intact：binary not artifact（null sim 0.08%），fixed vs random insensitive（Δ<0.053）， bootstrap=jackknife（ratio 0.96-1.04），REML confirms Henderson I（<0.4pp）。 这些是论文的guaranteed floor——无论worst scenario多bad，robustness is there。 Logprob analysis跨benchmarks显示更tight的range（3.5pp vs binary的5.7pp）， suggesting logprob-based scoring reduces benchmark-dependence。This is a minor but novel observation that can go in Discussion。\\n\"\n1000\t  },\n1001\t  {\n1002\t    \"name\": \"exp-005: 14B model extension\",\n1003\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B在datacenter GPU上的BF16/FP16测试。 Worst档中未执行——deps on exp-003 timeline + 无可用48GB+ GPU时间。\\n\",\n1004\t    \"results\": {\n1005\t      \"status\": \"NOT_COMPLETED\",\n1006\t      \"records_collected\": 0,\n1007\t      \"blocking_reason\": \"exp-003在deadline前4周才partially完成，exp-005的protocol 依赖exp-003确定的multi-hardware procedure。同时14B模型需要 ~24GB VRAM（bf16），PRO 6000可以跑但被P0实验占满。 无法在AAAI deadline前执行。\\n\"\n1008\t    },\n1009\t    \"tables\": [],\n1010\t    \"figures\": [],\n1011\t    \"analysis\": \"不fatal。论文scope明确为\\\"7-9B open-weight models\\\"。14B extension 适合ACL ARR camera-ready或后续独立paper。\\n\\n\\nexp-005的timeline依赖链：exp-003 partial completion → protocol finalization → 14B model runs。exp-003在T-4周才完成，来不及做exp-005的full crossing。 此外，14B模型的inference latency比8B高~1.8×，即使有GPU也难在deadline内 完成576 conditions × 2 models × 200 items = 230,400 records。 对论文的影响：所有结论限于7-9B模型规模。reviewer concern \\\"scale validation\\\" 只能在Limitations中acknowledge，argue \\\"7-9B是最commonly used open-weight model class\\\"。\\n\"\n1012\t  },\n1013\t  {\n1014\t    \"name\": \"exp-006: Fine-tuning G-study\",\n1015\t    \"description\": \"RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上的fine-tuning方差分解。 Worst档中未执行——P1优先级，GPU budget被P0消耗。\\n\",\n1016\t    \"results\": {\n1017\t      \"status\": \"NOT_COMPLETED\",\n1018\t      \"records_collected\": 0,\n1019\t      \"blocking_reason\": \"P1 priority。P0实验（exp-001 ~100h + exp-002 ~200h + exp-003 ~60h partial） 消耗了大部分GPU budget。1,728次fine-tuning runs × ~15min ≈ 430 GPU-hours 无法accommodate。\\n\"\n1020\t    },\n1021\t    \"tables\": [],\n1022\t    \"figures\": [],\n1023\t    \"analysis\": \"零影响。在Discussion中mention \\\"extending G-theory to fine-tuning variance is natural future work; Dodge et al. (2020) and Bui et al. (2025) provide preliminary evidence that seed/LR dominate fine-tuning variance\\\"。\\n\\n\\nPer D006 framing directive #5，fine-tuning已降级为Discussion-section preliminary observation，不是numbered contribution。即使完成，encoder-only RoBERTa的fine-tuning与decoder LLM inference的methodological gap也会被 reviewer指出。在worst档reframed narrative（MMLU case study + IRT comparison） 中，fine-tuning完全outside scope。\\n\"\n1024\t  },\n1025\t  {\n1026\t    \"name\": \"exp-007: LayerCast precision mitigation\",\n1027\t    \"description\": \"LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为额外precision条件。 P2优先级，worst档中未执行。\\n\",\n1028\t    \"results\": {\n1029\t      \"status\": \"NOT_COMPLETED\",\n1030\t      \"records_collected\": 0,\n1031\t      \"blocking_reason\": \"P2 priority, not attempted within AAAI timeline\"\n1032\t    },\n1033\t    \"tables\": [],\n1034\t    \"figures\": [],\n1035\t    \"analysis\": \"零影响。Precision在bf16/fp16上已经是non-issue（0.0006%）， LayerCast实验变得moot。\\n\\n\\nLayerCast是mitigation strategy evaluation，不是core finding。 BF16-vs-FP16 sensitivity已显示precision effect=0.0006%（接近zero）， LayerCast的additional data point价值marginal——precision已经不是 variance source。可以在Discussion中cite Yuan et al. (2025)的 LayerCast results as \\\"practitioners can further reduce precision variance via mixed-precision strategies\\\"。\\n\"\n1036\t  },\n1037\t  {\n1038\t    \"name\": \"exp-008: MATH benchmark extension\",\n1039\t    \"description\": \"MATH benchmark（200 items）测试reasoning-heavy任务的variance structure。 P2优先级且deps on exp-002，worst档中未执行。\\n\",\n1040\t    \"results\": {\n1041\t      \"status\": \"NOT_COMPLETED\",\n1042\t      \"records_collected\": 0,\n1043\t      \"blocking_reason\": \"P2 priority。Deps on exp-002 pipeline（已完成但consumed timeline）。 MATH的chain-of-thought generation需要significantly longer inference time （avg ~45 tokens vs MMLU ~1 token），200h GPU budget已用尽。\\n\"\n1044\t    },\n1045\t    \"tables\": [],\n1046\t    \"figures\": [],\n1047\t    \"analysis\": \"Marginal impact。4个benchmarks showing flat structure已经支撑 \\\"benchmark-insensitivity\\\" reframe。MATH would be 5th data point but not change the conclusion。适合ACL ARR补充。\\n\\nexp-002已经覆盖了GSM8K（math reasoning）、ARC（science reasoning）、 HellaSwag（commonsense），增加MATH的marginal value在worst档flat gradient 下更低——不会出现新pattern，只会是another data point在38-44% item_id区间内。 如果需要bolster \\\"benchmark-insensitivity\\\" claim，现有4个benchmarks （MMLU + 3 from exp-002）已经sufficient。\\n\"\n1048\t  }\n1049\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3e227914-44fc-4375-965c-962f04adfef3","uuid":"621a6489-875f-4237-aec5-b8cbed943217","timestamp":"2026-05-21T08:28:11.077Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T075006/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-001: Full-scale 4-model MMLU precision study\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models × 3 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。数据已收集完毕（Llama 239,200 + Gemma 172,800 + Mistral 259,200 + Qwen 259,200 = 930,400 total records）。Balanced cross-model analysis使用bf16 共享条件：432 conditions/model × 4 models × 200 items = 345,600 records。 核心数字已锁定。worst档新增两项robustness分析结果不理想： (a) leave-one-model-out matched-spec rerun显示G_item spread=0.058（>0.05）； (b) BF16-vs-FP16 sensitivity已完成确认precision=0.0006%（正面结果）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 930400,\n      \"balanced_cross_model_records\": 345600,\n      \"total_conditions\": 5184,\n      \"models_completed\": 4,\n      \"cross_4model_item_id_pct\": 42.1,\n      \"cross_4model_item_id_CI_95\": [\n        36.0,\n        48.8\n      ],\n      \"cross_4model_model_x_item_pct\": 33.6,\n      \"cross_4model_model_x_item_CI_95\": [\n        28.4,\n        37.9\n      ],\n      \"cross_4model_G_item\": 0.82,\n      \"cross_4model_G_item_CI_95\": [\n        0.782,\n        0.861\n      ],\n      \"d_study_3to4_predicted\": 0.816,\n      \"d_study_3to4_actual\": 0.82,\n      \"d_study_3to4_delta\": 0.004,\n      \"single_model_llama_item_id_pct\": 61.1,\n      \"per_model_interaction_mistral_pct\": 29.25,\n      \"per_model_interaction_qwen_pct\": 27.11,\n      \"per_model_interaction_gemma_pct\": 23.95,\n      \"per_model_interaction_llama_pct\": 19.69,\n      \"bf16_vs_fp16_precision_pct\": 0.0006,\n      \"bf16_vs_fp16_precision_x_item_pct\": 0.04,\n      \"infra_x_method_binary_pct\": 0.08,\n      \"residual_pct\": 19.5,\n      \"lomo_matched_spec_design\": \"bf16 × 4 prompts × 4 seeds × 2 temps × 2 orderings\",\n      \"lomo_drop_mistral_G_item\": 0.846,\n      \"lomo_drop_qwen_G_item\": 0.834,\n      \"lomo_drop_gemma_G_item\": 0.802,\n      \"lomo_drop_llama_G_item\": 0.788,\n      \"lomo_spread\": 0.058,\n      \"lomo_mean_G_item\": 0.818,\n      \"lomo_sd_G_item\": 0.026,\n      \"d_study_5model_G_item\": 0.848,\n      \"d_study_8model_G_item\": 0.893,\n      \"d_study_10model_G_item\": 0.91\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Cross-model variance decomposition (4 models, MMLU, balanced bf16)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"source\",\n            \"pct\",\n            \"CI_lower\",\n            \"CI_upper\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"item_id\",\n              42.1,\n              36.0,\n              48.8\n            ],\n            [\n              \"model_x_item\",\n              33.6,\n              28.4,\n              37.9\n            ],\n            [\n              \"residual\",\n              19.5,\n              16.2,\n              23.1\n            ],\n            [\n              \"prompt_x_item\",\n              4.6,\n              3.1,\n              6.4\n            ],\n            [\n              \"seed_x_item\",\n              4.7,\n              3.2,\n              6.5\n            ],\n            [\n              \"temperature\",\n              1.2,\n              0.4,\n              2.3\n            ],\n            [\n              \"model\",\n              0.8,\n              0.1,\n              2.1\n            ],\n            [\n              \"precision\",\n              0.0006,\n              0.0,\n              0.002\n            ],\n            [\n              \"other_interactions\",\n              0.5,\n              0.1,\n              1.2\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Leave-one-model-out matched-spec G_item\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"dropped_model\",\n            \"G_item\",\n            \"item_id_pct\",\n            \"model_x_item_pct\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Mistral\",\n              0.846,\n              44.8,\n              28.3\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Qwen\",\n              0.834,\n              43.2,\n              30.1\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Gemma\",\n              0.802,\n              40.5,\n              35.8\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Llama\",\n              0.788,\n              39.1,\n              37.6\n            ],\n            [\n              \"All_4\",\n              0.82,\n              42.1,\n              33.6\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Per-model single-model variance decomposition\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"source\",\n            \"llama_pct\",\n            \"gemma_pct\",\n            \"mistral_pct\",\n            \"qwen_pct\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"item_id\",\n              61.1,\n              57.8,\n              59.4,\n              55.6\n            ],\n            [\n              \"residual\",\n              17.2,\n              19.1,\n              18.4,\n              20.8\n            ],\n            [\n              \"precision_x_item\",\n              7.2,\n              7.8,\n              7.1,\n              6.5\n            ],\n            [\n              \"prompt_x_item\",\n              4.6,\n              5.3,\n              4.9,\n              6.2\n            ],\n            [\n              \"seed_x_item\",\n              4.7,\n              4.5,\n              4.6,\n              5.1\n            ],\n            [\n              \"temperature_x_item\",\n              3.1,\n              3.4,\n              3.2,\n              3.6\n            ],\n            [\n              \"temperature\",\n              1.2,\n              1.1,\n              1.5,\n              1.2\n            ],\n            [\n              \"precision\",\n              0.5,\n              0.6,\n              0.5,\n              0.7\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"exp-001的锁定数字是worst档论文的foundation——model×item=33.6%和D-study Δ=0.004无论其他实验如何都是solid findings。leave-one-model-out matched-spec spread=0.058是worst档的核心concern：它意味着4-model estimate有~3%的standard deviation，reviewer可以argue point estimate不够precise。 Defense策略：(1) 所有4个子集都保持qualitative结论（item_id最大，model×item second largest），spread影响的是magnitude不是ranking；(2) D-study projection 清晰显示adding models monotonically improves G_item，当前4-model是under-powered 但方向正确；(3) unmatched analysis的spread仅0.023，matched的0.058部分归因于 reduced design（64 vs 432 conditions），真实spread可能介于两者之间。 BF16-vs-FP16 sensitivity确认FP32 anomaly是vLLM artifact（positive result）。\\n\\n\\n核心cross-model数字已锁定不受worst档影响。worst档的关键问题在leave-one-model-out matched-spec rerun：初始unmatched analysis显示spread=0.023（看起来stable）， 但那是因为不同3-model子集使用了不同条件数（Gemma缺fp16→432 conditions/model vs其他648），设计不可比。matched-spec rerun统一使用最大公约数设计 （bf16 × 4 prompts × 4 seeds × 2 temps × 2 orderings = 64 conditions/model）， 条件数大幅减少使得估计精度下降。 Drop-Llama（spread最大端）G_item=0.788，因为Llama是interaction最低的模型 （19.69%），去掉它后剩余3模型（Mistral 29.25%、Qwen 27.11%、Gemma 23.95%） 的model×item更大，item difficulty generalizability更差。 Drop-Mistral（spread最小端）G_item=0.846，因为Mistral是interaction最高的模型 （29.25%），去掉它反而让剩余3模型的item ranking更一致。 Spread=0.058意味着G_item在[0.788, 0.846]区间内depending on model selection—— reviewer可以argue\\\"4个模型不够，G_item的point estimate不可靠\\\"。 但所有4个子集都保持G_item>0.78（>0.75阈值），item_id始终>35%且为最大source， 定性结论robust。这个fragility是real的，需要10+模型才能stabilize， 但在论文中可以honest报告并用D-study projection（10 models→G=0.910） 来argue方向是对的、只是当前sample不够大。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-001b: Item resampling stability test\",\n    \"description\": \"3个独立200-item分层抽样（seeds 0, 7, 99）× Llama × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample × 200 items = 10,800 records/sample。 Total 32,400 records。在worst档中，CV(item_id)=0.143，显示42%的point estimate 对item sampling敏感。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_samples\": 3,\n      \"conditions_per_sample\": 54,\n      \"records_per_sample\": 10800,\n      \"total_records\": 32400,\n      \"sample_seed0_item_id_pct\": 61.1,\n      \"sample_seed7_item_id_pct\": 52.8,\n      \"sample_seed99_item_id_pct\": 70.4,\n      \"item_id_mean_pct\": 61.4,\n      \"item_id_sd_pct\": 8.8,\n      \"item_id_cv\": 0.143,\n      \"sample_seed0_G_binary\": 0.611,\n      \"sample_seed7_G_binary\": 0.536,\n      \"sample_seed99_G_binary\": 0.689,\n      \"G_binary_mean\": 0.612,\n      \"G_binary_sd\": 0.077,\n      \"G_binary_cv\": 0.126,\n      \"sample_seed0_residual_pct\": 17.2,\n      \"sample_seed7_residual_pct\": 23.1,\n      \"sample_seed99_residual_pct\": 12.8,\n      \"residual_cv\": 0.293,\n      \"variance_ranking_preserved_all_samples\": true,\n      \"item_id_always_largest\": true,\n      \"profile_corr_seed0_seed7\": 0.79,\n      \"profile_corr_seed0_seed99\": 0.73,\n      \"profile_corr_seed7_seed99\": 0.76,\n      \"avg_profile_corr\": 0.76\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: Resampling stability across 3 item draws (single-model Llama)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"source\",\n            \"seed0_pct\",\n            \"seed7_pct\",\n            \"seed99_pct\",\n            \"mean_pct\",\n            \"sd_pct\",\n            \"cv\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"item_id\",\n              61.1,\n              52.8,\n              70.4,\n              61.4,\n              8.8,\n              0.143\n            ],\n            [\n              \"residual\",\n              17.2,\n              23.1,\n              12.8,\n              17.7,\n              5.2,\n              0.291\n            ],\n            [\n              \"precision_x_item\",\n              7.2,\n              8.7,\n              5.6,\n              7.2,\n              1.6,\n              0.217\n            ],\n            [\n              \"prompt_x_item\",\n              4.6,\n              5.8,\n              3.9,\n              4.8,\n              1.0,\n              0.201\n            ],\n            [\n              \"seed_x_item\",\n              4.7,\n              5.2,\n              4.2,\n              4.7,\n              0.5,\n              0.106\n            ],\n            [\n              \"temperature_x_item\",\n              3.1,\n              3.3,\n              2.7,\n              3.0,\n              0.3,\n              0.1\n            ],\n            [\n              \"temperature\",\n              1.2,\n              1.0,\n              0.9,\n              1.0,\n              0.2,\n              0.153\n            ],\n            [\n              \"precision\",\n              0.5,\n              0.6,\n              0.3,\n              0.5,\n              0.2,\n              0.333\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: G-coefficient stability across item draws\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"metric\",\n            \"seed0_G\",\n            \"seed7_G\",\n            \"seed99_G\",\n            \"mean_G\",\n            \"sd_G\",\n            \"cv\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"binary\",\n              0.611,\n              0.536,\n              0.689,\n              0.612,\n              0.077,\n              0.126\n            ],\n            [\n              \"text_exact\",\n              0.007,\n              0.005,\n              0.009,\n              0.007,\n              0.002,\n              0.286\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CV=0.143直接影响headline claim的precision——论文不能报告\\\"item_id=42.1%\\\" 作为definitive number，需要报告\\\"42.1% [range across item samples: ~36-48%]\\\"。 但这与bootstrap CI [36.0, 48.8]一致，说明resampling instability和statistical uncertainty是同一量级的——bootstrap CI已经captures了item sampling variability。 正面spin：(1) item_id始终是largest source（even at 52.8%远超residual 23.1%）， 定性结论robust；(2) resampling instability本身reinforces G-theory的item-as-facet treatment——如果item sampling无关紧要，就不需要G-theory了； (3) G_binary的CV=0.126 < item_id的CV=0.143，reliability比raw variance %更stable。 Reviewer concern \\\"连自己的estimate都不stable\\\"可以用\\\"this is precisely why D-study budgets recommend 500+ items\\\"来回应。\\n\\n\\n200 items是MMLU 14,042题的1.4%。即使分层抽样（按57个subjects），每个subject 内的difficulty分布仍有大量变异。seed 99抽到更多high-variance subjects （abstract_algebra, formal_logic, professional_medicine——这些subjects的item difficulty range极大，从trivial到near-impossible），导致item间方差膨胀至70.4%。 seed 7则抽到更多\\\"中等难度集中\\\"的subjects（high_school_biology, marketing）， item间差异较小，item_id降至52.8%。 CV=0.143意味着单次200-item抽样的item_id%有约14%的相对变异。 这不是catastrophic——variance ranking在所有3次抽样中保持（item_id始终最大）， 但足以让reviewer质疑\\\"42.1%\\\"这个具体数字。G系数的CV=0.126较低，说明 reliability estimate比variance percentage更robust——从0.536到0.689变化较大 但定性判断不变（全部<0.80阈值，需要more items）。 profile correlation平均0.76说明方差结构的shape有moderate一致性， 但不足以claim\\\"structure is invariant to item sampling\\\"。 关键defense：把instability本身spin为finding——\\\"item sampling is itself a major variance source, providing empirical justification for G-theory's item-as-facet treatment and D-study budgeting approach。\\\"\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-002: Multi-benchmark replication (flat gradient)\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models × 2 precisions (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures (T=0.0/T=0.7) × 4 orderings × 200 items on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。 Per benchmark: 4×2×6×6×2×4=2304 conditions × 200 items = 460,800 records。 Total: 1,382,400 records。Cross-model balanced analysis: bf16 only, 576 conditions/model × 4 × 200 = 230,400/benchmark。 结果：variance structure跨benchmark几乎不变，item_id range仅5.7pp， gradient narrative完全不成立。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records_all_benchmarks\": 1382400,\n      \"benchmarks_completed\": 3,\n      \"mmlu_cross_item_id_pct\": 42.1,\n      \"mmlu_cross_model_x_item_pct\": 33.6,\n      \"mmlu_cross_residual_pct\": 19.5,\n      \"mmlu_cross_G_item\": 0.82,\n      \"gsm8k_cross_item_id_pct\": 38.4,\n      \"gsm8k_cross_model_x_item_pct\": 31.8,\n      \"gsm8k_cross_residual_pct\": 22.6,\n      \"gsm8k_cross_prompt_x_item_pct\": 8.4,\n      \"gsm8k_cross_seed_x_item_pct\": 5.8,\n      \"gsm8k_cross_temperature_pct\": 3.2,\n      \"gsm8k_cross_G_item\": 0.682,\n      \"gsm8k_cross_G_binary_200items\": 0.438,\n      \"gsm8k_overall_accuracy\": 0.512,\n      \"arc_cross_item_id_pct\": 44.1,\n      \"arc_cross_model_x_item_pct\": 30.5,\n      \"arc_cross_residual_pct\": 18.8,\n      \"arc_cross_prompt_x_item_pct\": 5.2,\n      \"arc_cross_seed_x_item_pct\": 4.6,\n      \"arc_cross_temperature_pct\": 1.4,\n      \"arc_cross_G_item\": 0.718,\n      \"arc_cross_G_binary_200items\": 0.521,\n      \"arc_overall_accuracy\": 0.548,\n      \"hellaswag_cross_item_id_pct\": 41.8,\n      \"hellaswag_cross_model_x_item_pct\": 35.2,\n      \"hellaswag_cross_residual_pct\": 17.4,\n      \"hellaswag_cross_prompt_x_item_pct\": 3.8,\n      \"hellaswag_cross_seed_x_item_pct\": 4.2,\n      \"hellaswag_cross_temperature_pct\": 0.8,\n      \"hellaswag_cross_G_item\": 0.668,\n      \"hellaswag_cross_G_binary_200items\": 0.492,\n      \"hellaswag_overall_accuracy\": 0.621,\n      \"cross_bench_item_id_range_pp\": 5.7,\n      \"cross_bench_item_id_min\": 38.4,\n      \"cross_bench_item_id_max\": 44.1,\n      \"cross_bench_model_x_item_range_pp\": 4.7,\n      \"gradient_rank_knowledge_to_reasoning\": null,\n      \"gradient_linear_fit_R2\": 0.12,\n      \"separability_binary_mmlu_pct\": 0.08,\n      \"separability_binary_gsm8k_pct\": 3.6,\n      \"separability_binary_arc_pct\": 2.4,\n      \"separability_binary_hellaswag_pct\": 4.8,\n      \"separability_binary_max_pct\": 4.8,\n      \"d_study_mmlu_510items_G\": 0.8,\n      \"d_study_gsm8k_510items_G\": 0.753,\n      \"d_study_arc_510items_G\": 0.768,\n      \"d_study_hellaswag_510items_G\": 0.742,\n      \"d_study_cross_bench_delta_max\": 0.058,\n      \"d_study_cross_bench_delta_min\": 0.032,\n      \"d_study_cross_bench_delta_mean\": 0.047,\n      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu\": 4.1,\n      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k\": 1.7,\n      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_arc\": 2.5,\n      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag\": 1.6,\n      \"g_item_cross_bench_min\": 0.668,\n      \"g_item_cross_bench_max\": 0.82,\n      \"g_item_cross_bench_mean\": 0.722,\n      \"mmlu_matched_2x2_item_id_pct\": 43.8,\n      \"mmlu_matched_2x2_model_x_item_pct\": 32.4,\n      \"mmlu_matched_2x2_delta_from_full\": 1.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Cross-model variance decomposition by benchmark (4 models, bf16)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"source\",\n            \"mmlu_pct\",\n            \"gsm8k_pct\",\n            \"arc_pct\",\n            \"hellaswag_pct\",\n            \"range_pp\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"item_id\",\n              42.1,\n              38.4,\n              44.1,\n              41.8,\n              5.7\n            ],\n            [\n              \"model_x_item\",\n              33.6,\n              31.8,\n              30.5,\n              35.2,\n              4.7\n            ],\n            [\n              \"residual\",\n              19.5,\n              22.6,\n              18.8,\n              17.4,\n              5.2\n            ],\n            [\n              \"prompt_x_item\",\n              4.6,\n              8.4,\n              5.2,\n              3.8,\n              4.6\n            ],\n            [\n              \"seed_x_item\",\n              4.7,\n              5.8,\n              4.6,\n              4.2,\n              1.6\n            ],\n            [\n              \"temperature\",\n              1.2,\n              3.2,\n              1.4,\n              0.8,\n              2.4\n            ],\n            [\n              \"model\",\n              0.8,\n              1.2,\n              0.9,\n              0.6,\n              0.6\n            ],\n            [\n              \"precision\",\n              0.0006,\n              0.3,\n              0.1,\n              0.2,\n              0.3\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: G_item and IRT comparison by benchmark\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"benchmark\",\n            \"G_item_4model\",\n            \"G_binary_200items\",\n            \"irt_items_needed\",\n            \"gtheory_items_G80\",\n            \"ratio\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"MMLU\",\n              0.82,\n              0.611,\n              118,\n              510,\n              4.1\n            ],\n            [\n              \"GSM8K\",\n              0.682,\n              0.438,\n              286,\n              486,\n              1.7\n            ],\n            [\n              \"ARC-Challenge\",\n              0.718,\n              0.521,\n              178,\n              448,\n              2.5\n            ],\n            [\n              \"HellaSwag\",\n              0.668,\n              0.492,\n              312,\n              502,\n              1.6\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Cross-benchmark separability (binary, precision×methodology interaction)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"benchmark\",\n            \"prec_x_prompt_pct\",\n            \"prec_x_seed_pct\",\n            \"prec_x_temp_pct\",\n            \"total_infra_x_method_pct\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"MMLU\",\n              0.02,\n              0.01,\n              0.05,\n              0.08\n            ],\n            [\n              \"GSM8K\",\n              1.2,\n              0.8,\n              1.6,\n              3.6\n            ],\n            [\n              \"ARC-Challenge\",\n              0.9,\n              0.5,\n              1.0,\n              2.4\n            ],\n            [\n              \"HellaSwag\",\n              1.6,\n              1.1,\n              2.1,\n              4.8\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: D-study cross-benchmark transfer error\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"benchmark\",\n            \"mmlu_derived_G_at_510items\",\n            \"actual_G_at_510items\",\n            \"delta\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"MMLU\",\n              0.8,\n              0.8,\n              0.0\n            ],\n            [\n              \"GSM8K\",\n              0.8,\n              0.753,\n              0.047\n            ],\n            [\n              \"ARC-Challenge\",\n              0.8,\n              0.768,\n              0.032\n            ],\n            [\n              \"HellaSwag\",\n              0.8,\n              0.742,\n              0.058\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"exp-002是worst档叙事转向的关键实验。gradient死亡意味着原planned的 \\\"cross-benchmark variance gradient — the primary novel finding\\\"完全不可用。 但flat structure本身可以reframe： (1) Positive spin：\\\"variance structure is approximately benchmark-invariant\\\" → practitioners可以用MMLU结果cautiously extrapolate to other benchmarks。 这解决了一个practical question。 (2) D-study transfer error（Δ=0.03-0.06）限定了\\\"cautiously\\\"的程度—— MMLU-derived budgets会在其他benchmark上overestimate G by 3-6pp， 需要add 10-15% safety margin。 (3) IRT ratio的benchmark-dependence（1.6×-4.1×）是一个publishable finding 本身——解释了为什么field对\\\"IRT够不够\\\"的争论不收敛：答案是benchmark-dependent。 Separability failure across benchmarks（MMLU 0.08% vs HellaSwag 4.8%） means separability完全不能作为general claim，降为\\\"observed on MMLU under binary scoring; does not hold generally\\\"。 Net assessment: exp-002的data是有价值的，只是不支撑原叙事。reframe后 可以支撑contribution (3)（benchmark-insensitivity as positive）但forcing function是writing quality——flat results需要更skillful framing。\\n\\n\\nGradient叙事死掉的核心原因：item_id跨4个benchmark的range仅5.7pp （38.4%-44.1%）。原假设是knowledge benchmarks（MMLU）有高item_id（>55%）， reasoning benchmarks（GSM8K）有低item_id（<30%），形成20+pp的gradient。 实际结果是所有benchmark都落在38-44%的狭窄区间内。 为什么flat？model×item交互在所有benchmark上都在30-36%——这意味着无论 task type如何，模型间的item difficulty ranking disagreement程度类似。 直觉上，这是因为7-9B模型在knowledge和reasoning tasks上都有类似程度的 model-specific strengths/weaknesses：Llama在MMLU的history和GSM8K的 word problems上都相对strong，Mistral在MMLU的STEM和GSM8K的multi-step上 都相对weak——model-specificity的pattern在task types之间有一致性。 G_item跨benchmark从0.668到0.820变化较大（range=0.152），但这主要由 residual差异驱动而非model×item差异。GSM8K和HellaSwag的G_item低 （0.668-0.682）是因为higher residual（22.6%和17.4%+更高的prompt×item）， 不是因为model×item更大。 IRT ratio在GSM8K（1.7×）和HellaSwag（1.6×）上collapse到<2×，原因是 这些benchmark的IRT也需要更多items（item discrimination更uniform， 2PL model的efficiency advantage减弱），所以分母增大、ratio压缩。 MMLU上IRT仍然只需~120 items因为items有strong discrimination gradients （从trivial到impossible跨57 subjects），2PL拟合效率高。 Cross-benchmark separability failure（max=4.8% on HellaSwag binary） 原因：HellaSwag的sentence completion任务对precision和temperature的 交互更敏感——不同precision下temperature>0生成的completions有更多 divergence，且binary scoring的粒度在这类任务上captures了更多差异。 D-study cross-bench Δ=0.032-0.058意味着MMLU-derived budgets在其他 benchmark上systematically overestimate reliability by 3-6pp。这是因为 MMLU的residual较低（19.5%）相对于GSM8K（22.6%）——更多unexplained variance意味着需要更多observations来stabilize。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-003: Multi-hardware G-study (partial)\",\n    \"description\": \"原计划4 models × 2+ GPU types × 2 precisions × full crossing。 在worst档中，第二种GPU（RTX A6000 48GB）在deadline前4周获得， 仅完成2 models（Llama + Mistral）× 2 precisions（bf16/fp16）× 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items = 2 × 576 × 200 = 230,400 records。 Hardware × methodology interaction = 4.2% binary average，separability claim破裂。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"PARTIAL\",\n      \"gpu_types\": [\n        \"RTX_PRO_6000_96GB\",\n        \"RTX_A6000_48GB\"\n      ],\n      \"models_completed\": 2,\n      \"models\": [\n        \"Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\",\n        \"Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3\"\n      ],\n      \"total_records\": 230400,\n      \"conditions_per_model\": 576,\n      \"hardware_main_effect_pct\": 1.8,\n      \"hardware_x_precision_pct\": 0.9,\n      \"hardware_x_prompt_pct\": 0.6,\n      \"hardware_x_seed_pct\": 0.3,\n      \"hardware_x_temperature_pct\": 1.4,\n      \"hardware_x_item_pct\": 2.8,\n      \"total_hardware_x_methodology_pct\": 4.2,\n      \"hardware_x_methodology_llama_pct\": 3.8,\n      \"hardware_x_methodology_mistral_pct\": 4.6,\n      \"single_gpu_infra_x_method_pct\": 0.08,\n      \"multi_gpu_infra_x_method_pct\": 4.2,\n      \"delta_pp\": 4.12,\n      \"llama_pro6000_accuracy\": 0.6814,\n      \"llama_a6000_accuracy\": 0.6791,\n      \"llama_hardware_gap_pp\": 0.23,\n      \"mistral_pro6000_accuracy\": 0.6124,\n      \"mistral_a6000_accuracy\": 0.6083,\n      \"mistral_hardware_gap_pp\": 0.41,\n      \"G_binary_single_gpu\": 0.611,\n      \"G_binary_two_gpu\": 0.582,\n      \"G_delta\": 0.029\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: Hardware × methodology interaction breakdown (2 models, binary)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"interaction_term\",\n            \"llama_pct\",\n            \"mistral_pct\",\n            \"average_pct\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"hardware_x_temperature\",\n              1.1,\n              1.7,\n              1.4\n            ],\n            [\n              \"hardware_x_precision\",\n              0.7,\n              1.1,\n              0.9\n            ],\n            [\n              \"hardware_x_prompt\",\n              0.5,\n              0.7,\n              0.6\n            ],\n            [\n              \"hardware_x_seed\",\n              0.2,\n              0.4,\n              0.3\n            ],\n            [\n              \"hardware_x_item\",\n              2.4,\n              3.2,\n              2.8\n            ],\n            [\n              \"hardware_main\",\n              1.3,\n              2.3,\n              1.8\n            ],\n            [\n              \"total_hardware_related\",\n              6.2,\n              9.4,\n              7.8\n            ],\n            [\n              \"total_hardware_x_methodology\",\n              3.8,\n              4.6,\n              4.2\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"exp-003的partial completion足以kill separability claim但不够做full hardware G-study。只有2个模型意味着hardware×model interaction无法properly estimate。 但data is sufficient to downgrade separability from \\\"claim\\\" to \\\"observation limited to single-GPU environments\\\"。 论文framing：在Methods中honest报告\\\"hardware crossing was partially completed (2 of 4 models)\\\"，在Results中报告4.2% interaction as \\\"preliminary evidence that separability does not hold across GPU architectures\\\"，在Discussion中 qualify all prior separability statements to \\\"single-GPU, single-architecture\\\"。 这不fatal——separability在worst档叙事中已经不是contribution了。\\n\\n\\nHardware×methodology interaction从single-GPU的0.08%跳至multi-GPU的4.2%， 原因是两种GPU有不同的CUDA kernel implementations（RTX PRO 6000使用 sm_89 Ada Lovelace kernels，A6000使用sm_86 Ampere kernels）。 BF16 matrix multiply的rounding behavior在两种架构上不同——不是precision 本身的问题（bf16 spec相同），而是kernel-level implementation差异导致 少量items在一个GPU上答对、另一个上答错。 hardware×temperature=1.4%是最大sub-interaction，因为temperature>0时的 sampling受CUDA RNG implementation影响，不同GPU的cuRAND版本产生 不同的pseudo-random sequences（即使seed相同）。 hardware×item=2.8%反映了~5-8个items在两GPU间有consistently不同的 答案——这些items恰好在model的decision boundary上，kernel-level numerical differences足以flip prediction。 Mistral（4.6%）比Llama（3.8%）的hardware interaction更大，因为Mistral accuracy更低（61.2%），更多items在decision boundary附近。 这个结果对separability是definitive negative：\\\"infrastructure×methodology ≈0%\\\"只在single-GPU上成立。跨GPU，interaction是non-negligible的。 但4.2%仍然是minor relative to item_id（42.1%）和model×item（33.6%）， 所以the hierarchy is preserved——hardware interaction doesn't dominate。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-004: Comprehensive analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"基于exp-001/001b/002/003数据的全面分析。Worst档中exp-003仅有partial data， 但exp-001和exp-002完整。可执行13/17 planned analyses。 核心输出：IRT vs G-theory对比（benchmark-dependent ratio），D-study cross-benchmark transfer analysis，完整robustness package。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"planned_analyses\": 17,\n      \"executable_analyses\": 13,\n      \"blocked_analyses\": 4,\n      \"blocked_list\": [\n        \"full hardware G-study\",\n        \"hardware ranking stability\",\n        \"hardware logprob analysis\",\n        \"hardware cost optimization\"\n      ],\n      \"model_as_facet_item_id_pct\": 42.1,\n      \"model_as_facet_model_x_item_pct\": 33.6,\n      \"model_as_facet_G_item\": 0.82,\n      \"bootstrap_n\": 1000,\n      \"item_id_CI_95\": [\n        36.0,\n        48.8\n      ],\n      \"model_x_item_CI_95\": [\n        28.4,\n        37.9\n      ],\n      \"residual_CI_95\": [\n        16.2,\n        23.1\n      ],\n      \"G_item_CI_95\": [\n        0.782,\n        0.861\n      ],\n      \"G_binary_CI_95\": [\n        0.571,\n        0.652\n      ],\n      \"d_study_practical_items_G80_mmlu\": 510,\n      \"d_study_practical_items_G80_gsm8k\": 624,\n      \"d_study_practical_items_G80_arc\": 538,\n      \"d_study_practical_items_G80_hellaswag\": 652,\n      \"d_study_cross_bench_delta_range\": [\n        0.032,\n        0.058\n      ],\n      \"d_study_14k_mmlu_G\": 0.972,\n      \"reml_henderson_max_diff_pp\": 0.4,\n      \"reml_convergence_iterations\": 500,\n      \"reml_practical_convergence_delta\": 0.003,\n      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu\": 4.1,\n      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k\": 1.7,\n      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_arc\": 2.5,\n      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag\": 1.6,\n      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_mean\": 2.5,\n      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_sd\": 1.14,\n      \"min_detectable_interaction_pct\": 0.8,\n      \"power_at_1pct_interaction\": 0.94,\n      \"power_at_5pct_interaction\": 0.99,\n      \"G_all_random\": 0.611,\n      \"G_temp_fixed\": 0.634,\n      \"G_ordering_fixed\": 0.645,\n      \"G_both_fixed\": 0.664,\n      \"fixed_random_max_delta\": 0.053,\n      \"bernoulli_obs_variance_corr\": 0.91,\n      \"null_sim_item_id_pct\": 0.08,\n      \"obs_to_bernoulli_ratio\": 1.0008,\n      \"bootstrap_jackknife_CI_ratio_mean\": 1.02,\n      \"bootstrap_jackknife_CI_ratio_range\": [\n        0.96,\n        1.04\n      ],\n      \"mmlu_2x2_vs_3x3_max_delta_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"mmlu_14k_items_G_projected\": 0.972,\n      \"logprob_mmlu_item_id_pct\": 48.3,\n      \"logprob_gsm8k_item_id_pct\": 44.8,\n      \"logprob_arc_item_id_pct\": 46.1,\n      \"logprob_hellaswag_item_id_pct\": 45.9,\n      \"logprob_cross_bench_range_pp\": 3.5,\n      \"gpu_hours_G80_mmlu\": 340,\n      \"gpu_hours_G80_gsm8k\": 415,\n      \"gpu_hours_G80_hellaswag\": 430,\n      \"gpu_hours_G90_mmlu\": 890\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11: IRT vs G-theory item requirements by benchmark\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"benchmark\",\n            \"irt_2pl_items\",\n            \"gtheory_practical_items\",\n            \"ratio\",\n            \"gtheory_accounts_for\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"MMLU\",\n              118,\n              510,\n              4.1,\n              \"prompt + seed + ordering + temp + prec\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"GSM8K\",\n              286,\n              486,\n              1.7,\n              \"same facets; IRT also needs more items\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"ARC-Challenge\",\n              178,\n              448,\n              2.5,\n              \"same\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"HellaSwag\",\n              312,\n              502,\n              1.6,\n              \"same; IRT needs most items here\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 12: D-study budget recommendations by benchmark (G≥0.80, practical)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"benchmark\",\n            \"items\",\n            \"prompts\",\n            \"seeds\",\n            \"G_projected\",\n            \"CI_95\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"MMLU\",\n              510,\n              2,\n              3,\n              0.8,\n              \"[0.782, 0.825]\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"GSM8K\",\n              624,\n              3,\n              4,\n              0.801,\n              \"[0.774, 0.831]\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"ARC-Challenge\",\n              538,\n              2,\n              3,\n              0.8,\n              \"[0.778, 0.826]\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"HellaSwag\",\n              652,\n              3,\n              4,\n              0.802,\n              \"[0.771, 0.838]\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 13: Methodological robustness summary\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"analysis\",\n            \"result\",\n            \"status\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Binary not artifact (null sim)\",\n              \"item_id=0.08% vs obs 61.1% (737×)\",\n              \"PASS\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Fixed vs random sensitivity\",\n              \"max Δ(G)=0.053\",\n              \"PASS\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Bootstrap = Jackknife CIs\",\n              \"ratio range [0.96, 1.04]\",\n              \"PASS\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"REML vs Henderson I\",\n              \"max diff < 0.4pp\",\n              \"PASS\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Temperature stratification\",\n              \"binary G: 0.760→0.549 (T=0→0.7)\",\n              \"PASS\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Bernoulli variance correlation\",\n              \"r=0.91 (item variance partly mechanical)\",\n              \"NOTED\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"D-study cross-benchmark transfer\",\n              \"Δ=0.032-0.058\",\n              \"CAVEAT\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Leave-one-model-out matched\",\n              \"spread=0.058\",\n              \"CAVEAT\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"exp-004在worst档中的关键产出是benchmark-conditional IRT ratio——这是 新发现，解释了field对\\\"IRT够不够\\\"的长期争论。可以claim：\\\"The IRT-G-theory gap is benchmark-dependent, ranging from 1.6× (HellaSwag) to 4.1× (MMLU), because IRT item parameters (discrimination, difficulty) vary across task types\\\"。这不需要gradient叙事，是self-contained的。 D-study cross-benchmark transfer analysis（Δ=0.03-0.06）is nuanced： 正面解读是MMLU budgets are \\\"approximately right\\\" (within 6pp G)； 负面解读是they're \\\"not directly transferable\\\"。论文adopt中间立场： \\\"MMLU-derived budgets provide a lower bound; benchmark-specific calibration improves precision by 3-6pp G\\\"。 Robustness package的6个PASS + 2个CAVEAT provides methodological credibility。 CAVEAT items (D-study transfer, LOMO) are discussed honestly rather than hidden。\\n\\n\\nexp-004的analysis在worst档中产出两类结果： (1) Robust surviving findings（不受数据缺失影响）：IRT vs G-theory对比 在MMLU上4.1×（locked），但cross-benchmark显示ratio从1.6×到4.1×—— reviewer会说\\\"so the 3-4× claim is only valid for MMLU\\\"。ratio collapse的 原因：在reasoning benchmarks上，IRT的2PL model fit效率降低（items have 更uniform discrimination，lower slope parameters），IRT自己也需要更多items （GSM8K: 286 items vs MMLU: 118 items），所以G-theory的extra cost 相对缩小。论文可以claim \\\"3.6-4.4× on MMLU\\\" and \\\"1.6-4.1× benchmark- dependent range\\\"——后者本身是informative finding。 (2) Weakened findings：D-study cross-benchmark transfer Δ=0.03-0.06 意味着MMLU budgets不能直接apply to other benchmarks（会high by 3-6pp G）。 这undercuts contribution (3)的\\\"practitioners can extrapolate\\\"——需要加 significant caveat \\\"with 10-15% safety margin\\\"。 Robustness package全部基于exp-001 Llama数据，fully intact：binary not artifact（null sim 0.08%），fixed vs random insensitive（Δ<0.053）， bootstrap=jackknife（ratio 0.96-1.04），REML confirms Henderson I（<0.4pp）。 这些是论文的guaranteed floor——无论worst scenario多bad，robustness is there。 Logprob analysis跨benchmarks显示更tight的range（3.5pp vs binary的5.7pp）， suggesting logprob-based scoring reduces benchmark-dependence。This is a minor but novel observation that can go in Discussion。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-005: 14B model extension\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B在datacenter GPU上的BF16/FP16测试。 Worst档中未执行——deps on exp-003 timeline + 无可用48GB+ GPU时间。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"NOT_COMPLETED\",\n      \"records_collected\": 0,\n      \"blocking_reason\": \"exp-003在deadline前4周才partially完成，exp-005的protocol 依赖exp-003确定的multi-hardware procedure。同时14B模型需要 ~24GB VRAM（bf16），PRO 6000可以跑但被P0实验占满。 无法在AAAI deadline前执行。\\n\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"不fatal。论文scope明确为\\\"7-9B open-weight models\\\"。14B extension 适合ACL ARR camera-ready或后续独立paper。\\n\\n\\nexp-005的timeline依赖链：exp-003 partial completion → protocol finalization → 14B model runs。exp-003在T-4周才完成，来不及做exp-005的full crossing。 此外，14B模型的inference latency比8B高~1.8×，即使有GPU也难在deadline内 完成576 conditions × 2 models × 200 items = 230,400 records。 对论文的影响：所有结论限于7-9B模型规模。reviewer concern \\\"scale validation\\\" 只能在Limitations中acknowledge，argue \\\"7-9B是最commonly used open-weight model class\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-006: Fine-tuning G-study\",\n    \"description\": \"RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上的fine-tuning方差分解。 Worst档中未执行——P1优先级，GPU budget被P0消耗。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"NOT_COMPLETED\",\n      \"records_collected\": 0,\n      \"blocking_reason\": \"P1 priority。P0实验（exp-001 ~100h + exp-002 ~200h + exp-003 ~60h partial） 消耗了大部分GPU budget。1,728次fine-tuning runs × ~15min ≈ 430 GPU-hours 无法accommodate。\\n\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"零影响。在Discussion中mention \\\"extending G-theory to fine-tuning variance is natural future work; Dodge et al. (2020) and Bui et al. (2025) provide preliminary evidence that seed/LR dominate fine-tuning variance\\\"。\\n\\n\\nPer D006 framing directive #5，fine-tuning已降级为Discussion-section preliminary observation，不是numbered contribution。即使完成，encoder-only RoBERTa的fine-tuning与decoder LLM inference的methodological gap也会被 reviewer指出。在worst档reframed narrative（MMLU case study + IRT comparison） 中，fine-tuning完全outside scope。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-007: LayerCast precision mitigation\",\n    \"description\": \"LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为额外precision条件。 P2优先级，worst档中未执行。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"NOT_COMPLETED\",\n      \"records_collected\": 0,\n      \"blocking_reason\": \"P2 priority, not attempted within AAAI timeline\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"零影响。Precision在bf16/fp16上已经是non-issue（0.0006%）， LayerCast实验变得moot。\\n\\n\\nLayerCast是mitigation strategy evaluation，不是core finding。 BF16-vs-FP16 sensitivity已显示precision effect=0.0006%（接近zero）， LayerCast的additional data point价值marginal——precision已经不是 variance source。可以在Discussion中cite Yuan et al. (2025)的 LayerCast results as \\\"practitioners can further reduce precision variance via mixed-precision strategies\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-008: MATH benchmark extension\",\n    \"description\": \"MATH benchmark（200 items）测试reasoning-heavy任务的variance structure。 P2优先级且deps on exp-002，worst档中未执行。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"NOT_COMPLETED\",\n      \"records_collected\": 0,\n      \"blocking_reason\": \"P2 priority。Deps on exp-002 pipeline（已完成但consumed timeline）。 MATH的chain-of-thought generation需要significantly longer inference time （avg ~45 tokens vs MMLU ~1 token），200h GPU budget已用尽。\\n\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Marginal impact。4个benchmarks showing flat structure已经支撑 \\\"benchmark-insensitivity\\\" reframe。MATH would be 5th data point but not change the conclusion。适合ACL ARR补充。\\n\\nexp-002已经覆盖了GSM8K（math reasoning）、ARC（science reasoning）、 HellaSwag（commonsense），增加MATH的marginal value在worst档flat gradient 下更低——不会出现新pattern，只会是another data point在38-44% item_id区间内。 如果需要bolster \\\"benchmark-insensitivity\\\" claim，现有4个benchmarks （MMLU + 3 from exp-002）已经sufficient。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1049,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1049}}}
